{"slug":"kh-w-f","ar":"خ و ف","total":124,"core":"fear","forms":[{"ar":"خَافَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":83,"gloss":"to fear","word":null,"ex":{"s":91,"a":15,"p":2,"ar":["وَلَا","يَخَافُ","عُقْبَـٰهَا"],"en":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof"}},{"ar":"خَوْف","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":26,"gloss":"Fear","word":"89","ex":{"s":106,"a":4,"p":7,"ar":["ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَطْعَمَهُم","مِّن","جُوعٍ","وَءَامَنَهُم","مِّنْ","خَوْفٍۭ"],"en":"Who has fed them, [saving them] from hunger and made them safe, [saving them] from fear"}},{"ar":"خِيفَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"fear","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":67,"p":4,"ar":["فَأَوْجَسَ","فِى","نَفْسِهِۦ","خِيفَةً","مُّوسَىٰ"],"en":"And he sensed within himself apprehension, did Moses"}},{"ar":"يُخَوِّفُ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":4,"gloss":"to frighten","word":null,"ex":{"s":3,"a":175,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّمَا","ذَٰلِكُمُ","ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","يُخَوِّفُ","أَوْلِيَآءَهُۥ","فَلَا","تَخَافُوهُمْ","وَخَافُونِ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّؤْمِنِينَ"],"en":"That is only Satan who frightens [you] of his supporters. So fear them not, but fear Me, if you are [indeed] believers"}},{"ar":"خَآئِف","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"fearful","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":21,"p":3,"ar":["فَخَرَجَ","مِنْهَا","خَآئِفًا","يَتَرَقَّبُ ۖ","قَالَ","رَبِّ","نَجِّنِى","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ"],"en":"So he left it, fearful and anticipating [apprehension]. He said, \"My Lord, save me from the wrongdoing people"}},{"ar":"تَخَوُّف","kind":"verbal noun","form":5,"count":1,"gloss":"gradual wasting; dread","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":47,"p":4,"ar":["أَوْ","يَأْخُذَهُمْ","عَلَىٰ","تَخَوُّفٍ","فَإِنَّ","رَبَّكُمْ","لَرَءُوفٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"en":"Or that He would not seize them gradually [in a state of dread]? But indeed, your Lord is Kind and Merciful"}},{"ar":"تَخْوِيف","kind":"verbal noun","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"warning, frightening","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":59,"p":21,"ar":["وَمَا","مَنَعَنَآ","أَن","نُّرْسِلَ","بِٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","إِلَّآ","أَن","كَذَّبَ","بِهَا","ٱلْأَوَّلُونَ ۚ","وَءَاتَيْنَا","ثَمُودَ","ٱلنَّاقَةَ","مُبْصِرَةً","فَظَلَمُوا۟","بِهَا ۚ","وَمَا","نُرْسِلُ","بِٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","إِلَّا","تَخْوِيفًا"],"en":"And nothing has prevented Us from sending signs except that the former peoples denied them. And We gave Thamud the she-camel as a visible sign, but they wronged her. And We send not the signs except as a warning"}}],"surahs":[[2,12],[4,8],[28,8],[20,7],[5,6],[6,6],[11,6],[7,5],[3,4],[26,4],[8,3],[10,3],[13,3],[16,3],[17,3],[24,3],[30,3],[39,3],[40,3],[51,3],[14,2],[19,2],[27,2],[33,2],[46,2],[76,2],[9,1],[12,1],[29,1],[32,1],[38,1],[41,1],[43,1],[48,1],[50,1],[55,1],[59,1],[72,1],[74,1],[79,1],[91,1],[106,1]]}